  m_Name: ModOperatorBlock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OperatorDefinition
  Name: Modulo
  Documentation: 'Modulo operation, returns the remainder of a division.


    For
    example,

    11 % 2 = 1 because 2 goes in eleven 5 times (10) with 1 left over.


    Use
    cases:

    Getting the last digit of a number: 5012 % 10 = 2

    Checking if
    a number is divisible by a number: 10 % 2 = 0, 10 is divisible by 2. 11 % 2 =
    1, 11 is <b>not</b> divisible by 2.'
